### ========================================
### CLIENTES - /api/customers
### Reemplaza <TOKEN> con el token del login
### ========================================

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "CLI-001",
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "García",
  "email": "maria.garcia@example.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "address": "Calle 10 # 5-20, Bogotá",
  "customerType": "RETAIL",
  "creditLimit": 500000.00
}

### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "CLI-001",
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "García Actualizada",
  "email": "maria.garcia@example.com",
  "phone": "3009876543",
  "address": "Carrera 5 # 10-30, Bogotá",
  "customerType": "WHOLESALE",
  "creditLimit": 1000000.00
}

### Obtener cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener cliente por código
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/code/CLI-001
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener cliente por email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/email/maria.garcia@example.com
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar clientes activos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/status/active
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar clientes por tipo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/type/RETAIL
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar clientes morosos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/status/morosos
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Desactivar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Activar cliente
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/activate
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Verificar crédito disponible para un monto
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/credit-available/100000
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener balance del cliente (crédito, saldo pendiente)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
